   "rotation": 0.0,
   "text": "3. Evacuation drills\nQuarterly evacuation drills are mandatory at every station. The Operations Control Centre must complete the pending drills and report to the Chief Safety Officer not later than 31 August 2026.\nനടപ്പുപാദത്തിലെ ഒഴിപ്പിക്കൽ പരിശീലനം 2026 ഓഗസ്റ്റ് 31-ന് മുമ്പ് പൂർത്തിയാക്കി ഓപ്പറേഷൻസ് കൺട്രോൾ സെന്ററിന് റിപ്പോർട്ട് ചെയ്യണം.\n4. Smoke detection\nThe Signalling and Telecom department is responsible for restoring both faulty smoke detection loops. Until restoration, a fire watch is required at the affected platforms during all service hours.\nStation staff were retrained on extinguisher handling in July, and attendance records are held by Human Resources for inspection.",
